oliday stretch but I'm  gonna be around 9,000 by the time the  year is over that is insane I am more  than septuple to my subscriber base in  one year and for how long I've been  doing this that's nuts that thing's  ramped up that quickly and are  continuing to so I've got a couple of  milestones coming up as a result of that  I'm coming very close to 500 300 and  10,000 subscribers don't know which of  those two I'll hit first but I want to  kind of mark the occasion and I thought  the fun way to do that would to be would  be to do a QA so I'm taking your  questions whether it's about the channel  about me about whatever you know my  whatever you want to ask me you can drop  it here in the comments you can send it  to me in an email council of geeks at  gmail you can hit me up on Twitter at  Council of geeks however you want to  send your question in do it and I might  answer it I make no promises as to how  many of these I'll answer the  how many I get what they are and and  I'll deal with that when when the time  comes but to mark 10,000 subscribers and  or 500 videos whatever happens first ya  gonna do a QA so send me the questions  I'll answer them cuz I do want to mark  the occasion I do want to celebrate  because this has been in terms of this  channel and the growth of it has been  amazing and I'm really grateful and  thankful and I hope everybody has a  really fantastic 2018 so until next time  this council is adjourned  [Applause]  [Applause]
 

